# Arweave project guidance

**`AGENTS.md`** at the repository root is the agent entry point. Shared
engineering guidance lives in **`doc/agents/`**. Read `AGENTS.md` and follow it.

It covers build and test commands, project structure, configuration,
Erlang style, testing conventions, and protocol caveats.

Do not add guidance to this file — update `AGENTS.md` or the relevant
`doc/agents/*.md` instead, so agents that don't read Cursor rules still see it.
